# NB: never add a bare `build/` rule. src/taxonomy/build/ holds the committed
# custom-taxonomy overlay (nodes.dmp / names.dmp / delnodes.txt) that
# build_policy.py layers on top of the NCBI taxdump to resolve the 13
# synthetic Kalamari taxids. Anchor the rules to the repo root instead.
/build/
/dist/

